(21, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 73, 60, 'pending', 4, 2, 5, 'This project involves the selective targeting of TRAF1/ASK1 axes in liver disease. Objective 1 of Task 1.1 a (sub cloning work) is completed. Task 1.1b is in progress as of November 2024. Plans to commence objective 4 (Task 4.1) are underway. Collaborative aspect of the project appears to be underway.', 'No journal publications submitted as yet.', 'One Undergraduate student on recruited on the project, one GA application pending to joining as PhD student in Spring.', 1, 1, NULL, '2024-12-02 11:33:00', '2024-12-02 11:33:00', 3, 'Almost 100% utilization of budget for the first year.'),
(22, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 73, 64, 'pending', 3, 2, 4, 'This proposal details a multimodal approach in investigating the role of leptin to adiponectin ratio and Nck1-YAP pathway in distributed flow-induced atherosclerosis. All aims are still in progress, none completed as yet. IBC approval has been abtained.', 'Committed to publish 5 articles. None published yet.', 'Committed to supervise 3PhD students. 2 PhD students recruited. There is evidence of crosstalk between QU and international collaborators.', -1, 1, NULL, '2024-12-03 04:54:51', '2024-12-05 04:33:31', 3, 'Researchers claim that they requested $80000/year in order to achieve the aims of the project but received 40000 instead. They add that this significant shortfall will impact the ability to achieve all aims and may necessitate adjustment to project time lines.'),
(23, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 74, 62, 'pending', 4, 4, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, -1, 1, NULL, '2024-12-04 05:33:39', '2024-12-04 05:39:56', 5, NULL),
(24, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 72, 47, 'pending', 4, 5, 5, 'The progress is satisfactory as the team has prepared the 50 lessons in the first year if the grant as stated in the proposal. In the Report, however, there seems to be some inconsistency. Table II Row 1 ays that all 40-50 lessons have been developed, but Row-5 says that lessons 26-50 in progress.', 'A Paper for Reading Psychology, which is a Q-1 journal, is in progress.', 'Iman Morsi and Aaya Abdelmeguid have been recruited as part of the capacity building policy. This , however, could not be verified independently.', 0, 1, NULL, '2024-12-08 03:55:27', '2024-12-09 03:00:41', 5, 'About 41% of the total budget has been utilized.'),
(25, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 48, 41, 'pending', 4, 4, 3, 'The authors successfully accomplished the majority of the objectives outlined in the Year 1 Grant Proposal.', 'The authors have published one paper in Materials Today Sustainability, (Q1- Impact factor 7.1). They also mentioned that several other papers are still in preparation.', 'Two RAs have been employed in this project.', 1, 1, NULL, '2024-12-08 04:37:42', '2024-12-08 04:37:42', 5, 'Actual Expenses:> 70%'),
(26, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 39, 67, 'pending', 3, 2, 5, 'The team has developend sufficient progress towards the proposed outcome regarding the short time they spent on the proect due to the delay in signing the agreement with foreign partners.', 'The team managend to publish two confrence presentations so far. Its recommended that they should focus more on journal papers in the coming year.', 'An excelent number of graduate and under graduate number of students has been invilved in the project.', -1, 1, NULL, '2024-12-08 04:46:34', '2024-12-08 04:46:34', 4, 'with the relatively short time since the actual start of the project, the research team managned to spend around 80% of the alocated project which is  justified.'),
(27, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 48, 61, 'pending', 5, 4, 5, 'The authors successfully accomplished the majority of the objectives outlined in the Year 1 Grant Proposal.', 'The authors have published one paper in Civil Engineering Journal. They also mentioned that several other papers are still under review and in preparation.', '3 RAs, 2 PhD and 1 MSc have been employed in this project.', 0, 1, NULL, '2024-12-08 04:59:00', '2024-12-08 04:59:00', 5, 'Actual Expenses:> 70%'),
(28, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 48, 44, 'pending', 4, 4, 5, 'The authors successfully accomplished the majority of the objectives outlined in the Year 1 Grant Proposal.', 'The authors have published one paper in ACCESS.2024.3486989 DOI: 10.1109/ACCESS.2024.3486989. They also mentioned that several other papers are still in preparation.', 'Five RAs and 1 BSs have been employed in this project.', -1, 1, NULL, '2024-12-08 05:10:37', '2024-12-08 05:10:37', 4, 'Actual Expenses:> 70%'),
(29, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 39, 43, 'pending', 4, 1, 2, 'The research team has managed to achieve the following results which are inline with the project proposal:\r\nPrepared electrospun copolyamide nanofiber membranes.\r\n• Prepared surface-modified copolyamide membranes using plasma treatment.\r\n• Detailed characterizations \r\n• Tested the oil/water mixture separation capability .\r\n• Prepared and tested surface-modified zeolite to remove oil\r\nfrom produced water.', 'Two major comments need to be answered by the LPI:\r\n1- The published paper is neither inline with the research proposal scope of work nor inline with the progress towards acheiving the outcomes declared in the progress report.\r\n2- The LPI name inside Qatar University do not appear in the authorship of the claimed published paper.', 'Student engagement was not mentionned in the progress report.', 3, 1, NULL, '2024-12-08 05:44:31', '2024-12-08 05:44:31', 1, NULL),
