(40, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 71, 50, 'pending', 4, 4, 3, 'The project has made impressive progress toward achieving its expected outcomes and has significantly contributed to capacity-building efforts. Although some areas still require improvement, the progress achieved so far establishes a strong foundation for continued development.', 'Two papers are currently in preparation, demonstrating significant progress in their development.', NULL, 1, 1, NULL, '2024-12-25 04:16:01', '2024-12-25 04:37:36', 4, NULL),
