(42, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 18, 42, 'pending', 3, 3, 5, 'The proposed outcomes are 7 publications, however only one is published in the field, two in polymer journal not related to the scope of work of this project and only submitted for publications.', 'Please see the comment above. Also, all publications do not show the LPI as a senior author except one article which is accepted for publications in the journal of Polymer Sciences.', NULL, -1, 1, NULL, '2025-01-22 03:35:33', '2025-01-22 03:35:33', 3, 'I can\'t answer as no budget utilization info is submitted. I accept this progress report with recommendation for LPI to focus more on the scope of work'),
(43, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 71, 233, 'pending', 2, 1, 1, 'The report indicates that the entire year has been largely spent on preparatory activities and administrative paperwork. To date, ethical approval has not been obtained from either HMC or QU. Consequently, the actual research work has not yet commenced. Ethical approval must be secured from both HMC and QU before the study can begin, as the team has not yet submitted an IBC application to QU.', 'The team has yet to produce any peer-reviewed publications.', 'One graduate student is mentioned, but neither their name nor their QU ID is provided. Since laboratory activities have not yet commenced, it is assumed that the student has not participated in any research activities to date.', 0, 1, NULL, '2025-11-20 07:05:27', '2025-11-20 07:05:27', 1, 'No information regarding budget utilization is provided in the report.'),
