(53, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 49, 229, 'pending', 3, 3, 4, 'The progress made is appropriate for this stage of the project.', 'There is on conference paper published', 'Two master students and one phd student', -1, 1, NULL, '2025-11-22 14:24:14', '2025-11-22 14:24:24', 5, NULL),
(54, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 71, 234, 'pending', 2, 1, 1, 'During Year 1, the majority of the effort was dedicated to administrative preparation, securing all required approvals, and completing the necessary documentation and coordination processes with HMC. As a result, no laboratory work was initiated during this period.', 'No publications have been produced to date, despite the team’s original commitment to deliver three manuscripts over the course of the project. At this stage, there is no evidence of progress toward any of the planned publications, and no drafts or preliminary data have been submitted for review.', 'They stated that a Research Assistant was recruited; however, they did not provide the recruitment date or the job number. Essential details are missing from their reports, and the progress report must be completed fully and accurately in accordance with the required template.', 1, 1, NULL, '2025-11-23 03:40:21', '2025-11-23 03:40:21', 1, 'It is not possible to evaluate the budget, as no details regarding the actual expenses have been provided. Furthermore, essential information is missing from the reports. The progress report must be completed fully and accurately in accordance with the required template to ensure proper assessment and compliance.'),
(55, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 183, 266, 'pending', 4, 3, 5, 'Most Year-1 objectives were completed or are in advanced progress (framework completed, IRB secured, data structure and ML/DL pipeline designed). Prototype development has not yet started due to procurement delays. Solid conceptual and preparatory work, but tangible outputs (prototype/software) are still pending.', 'Two papers were submitted to Q1/Q2 journals (“Education Sciences” and “Sustainability”) and are under review. However, there are no accepted publications yet, and institutional guidelines require publications ≥3 months after the award and with the LPI as co-author. Progress is moderate but not yet fully realized.', '2 master\'s students (QUIDs provided).\r\n\r\n3 undergraduate students (QUIDs provided).\r\nThese numbers exceed proposal commitments and show meaningful student engagement in research tasks, data collection, and system development support', 1, 1, NULL, '2025-11-23 18:22:28', '2025-11-24 18:48:11', 5, 'Year 1 budget: 123,284.97 QAR\r\nYear 1 spent: 120,000 QAR\r\nUtilization rate: 97%, meeting and exceeding the minimum 60% threshold.\r\nBudget use is appropriate and demonstrates good financial management.'),
(56, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 71, 281, 'pending', 4, 4, 5, 'The report demonstrates tremendous progress, reflecting significant achievements toward the project objectives and highlighting the team’s dedication and effective execution of planned activities.', 'The report indicates that the team has met their publication commitments, with one paper already accepted and another currently under review. However, the actual copies of the publications were not attached, which limits verification of these accomplishments.', 'The report highlights strong involvement of both students and research assistants in the ongoing project activities, reflecting substantial capacity-building efforts and demonstrating the team’s commitment to developing research skills and expertise among junior members.', 0, 1, NULL, '2025-11-24 04:52:00', '2025-11-24 04:52:00', 5, 'The report demonstrates appropriate and efficient utilization of the allocated budget, indicating careful financial management and alignment of expenditures with the planned project activities.'),
(57, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 71, 278, 'pending', 5, 5, 5, 'Great Progress', NULL, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, '2025-11-24 04:56:37', '2025-11-24 04:56:37', 5, NULL),
(58, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 71, 277, 'pending', 3, 1, 4, 'The QU-IRB approval must be submitted and obtained prior to initiating any work involving human data to ensure full compliance with ethical guidelines and regulatory requirements.', 'The team had committed to publishing two papers; however, this target has not yet been fully achieved, highlighting a gap between planned and completed outputs.', NULL, 0, 1, NULL, '2025-11-24 05:09:36', '2025-11-24 05:09:36', 2, 'The report indicates that the budget has not been fully utilized, with only approximately 40% of the allocated funds expended. This underutilization suggests delays or inefficiencies in implementing planned project activities and may require closer monitoring to ensure optimal use of resources.'),
(59, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 71, 238, 'pending', 4, 5, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, '2025-11-24 06:53:25', '2025-11-24 06:53:25', 4, NULL),
(60, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 71, 301, 'pending', 4, 4, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, '2025-11-24 07:07:04', '2025-11-24 07:07:04', 4, NULL),
(61, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 71, 302, 'pending', 4, 4, 5, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, '2025-11-24 07:09:21', '2025-11-24 07:09:21', 5, NULL),
(62, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 183, 267, 'pending', 4, 1, 5, 'Substantial conceptual and methodological progress is evident in the framework developed, the survey designed, the IRB submitted, and the students engaged. However, no tangible outputs (validated tool, model, or publications) have been completed yet. The prototype/model is only “in progress.” Overall, solid first-year work, but missing early deliverables.', 'No publications have been produced yet, and none have been reported as submitted. Proposal commits to Q1/Q2 papers, but no outputs appear in Year 1. This is expected at an early stage but still counts as “no progress” under the rubric.', 'Excellent student engagement. Two RAs were hired and contributed to evidence synthesis and literature categorization. This matches and fully meets proposal commitments.', 1, 1, NULL, '2025-11-24 17:52:51', '2025-11-24 17:52:51', 5, 'Budget use is strong: 95,866 QAR have already been spent in Year 1, exceeding the 60% requirement. Expenditures align with early research phases (tool design, translation, RA work). No concerns noted.'),
(63, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 183, 269, 'pending', 5, 3, 5, 'The project is fully aligned with the approved timeline. WP1–WP3 are progressing as planned, with major achievements including finalized simulation scenarios (V2V & adaptive brake lights), literature review, and IRB clearance. No delays reported. Tangible development includes functional V2V visual interface and brake light prototypes.', 'One publication has been submitted to the WCTR conference with a targeted Q2 journal special issue. No Q1 publications yet, and no accepted journal papers so far. Publication dates comply with the “3-month after award” requirement. LPI and the team are listed as co-authors.', 'Strong student engagement. A PhD student (Zahid Hussain) is co-supervised under this grant, and part of his dissertation will be completed within the project. A research assistant is fully employed under the project (Feb–Dec 2025).', 1, 1, NULL, '2025-11-24 18:05:23', '2025-11-24 18:05:23', 5, '100% of the Year-1 budget (150,000 QAR) has been spent as reported. This exceeds the minimum 60% required utilization and aligns with the planned Year-1 heavy investment in simulator development, RA salary, and equipment.'),
(64, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 183, 283, 'pending', 4, 2, 5, 'The project shows strong progress: two aims completed (scoping review and content evaluation) and aim 3 underway, with aim 4 scheduled next. Evidence of tangible outputs (training modules under development) is clear. However, no prototype/program has been fully delivered yet, and pilot testing has not begun.', 'No journal publications published yet. One manuscript is “under review,” but not yet accepted and not Q1/Q2 verified. Conference presentations and posters are documented, but these do not meet journal-publication commitments. There is no evidence that any claimed publication meets the “≥3 months post-award” rule or includes the LPI as co-author.', 'Excellent student engagement. Two undergraduate students directly contributed to the scoping review and research process, fulfilling the commitment listed in the proposal. Capacity building is clearly documented and meaningful.', 0, 0, NULL, '2025-11-24 18:13:51', '2025-11-24 18:13:51', 4, 'Approx. 50% (75,000 / 149,000) spent in Year 1. Utilization is generally adequate but does not yet meet the required 60% threshold for the first year. The remaining spending is likely tied to the pilot phase and development work planned for the next period.'),
(65, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 183, 284, 'pending', 4, 2, 3, 'The project shows strong advancement in systematic review steps (searching, screening, and data extraction) and preparatory work for the RCT, including IRB approval from QU and development of consent forms and scenarios. However, no tangible outputs (prototype/software) are expected for this type of research. Timelines appear realistic and aligned with the proposal.', 'No publications have been produced yet, and none are listed as submitted in high-ranked journals despite early manuscript drafting for the SR and protocol. Proposal commitments indicate 1–2 Q1/Q2 papers, but progress is still at 0 outputs. Publication timelines must accelerate.', 'Two undergraduate students are involved, and one RA has been hired (Dana Nizar Mustafa). Engagement is evident but limited. No master\'s or PhD students are involved, despite the proposal identifying potential MSc participation.', 1, 1, NULL, '2025-11-24 18:20:50', '2025-11-24 18:20:50', 3, 'Year 1 expenses are still listed as TBC, so actual utilization cannot be verified. It is unclear whether 60% of the budget has been used, as required by QU policy. Spending delays may affect the timely completion of RCT activities.'),
(66, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 183, 288, 'pending', 5, 3, 5, 'The project demonstrates strong progress toward its stated outcomes. Multiple work packages are completed or in advanced stages—validated tools, IRB approval, quantitative data collection, interview phase, and manuscript drafting (e.g., items 1–10 in the progress table). The work aligns closely with the proposal timeline and deliverables.', 'A manuscript has been drafted, and revisions are in progress, with results presented at a conference (mid-October). However, no journal publications have yet been completed or published. Proposal commitments required multiple Q1/Q2 papers (4 Q1 + 5 Q2). Publication progress is moderate but not yet meeting output expectations for year 1.', 'Strong evidence of student engagement: multiple undergraduate and graduate RAs are involved, with specific names listed (e.g., Huda Al Yafai, Razan Azzam, Areen Hayajneh) and clear roles in data collection and analysis. Capacity-building activities align well with proposal commitments.', 1, 1, NULL, '2025-11-24 18:26:55', '2025-11-24 18:26:55', 2, 'Year-1 budget utilization is only 32,842.36 QAR out of 149,779 QAR—approximately 22%, well below the required 60% first-year utilization threshold. Allocation appears conservative and may hinder progress in upcoming phases unless accelerated.'),
(67, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 183, 276, 'pending', 4, 3, 5, 'Strong progress on major objectives: Aim 1 completed with a Q1 manuscript submitted (Sep 14, 2025). Delphi Round 1 recruitment and data collection are well advanced (208 responses), and analysis has been initiated. Remaining objectives (Round 2, variability analysis) are not yet started but remain within the proposed timeline. No prototype/patent expected per proposal.', 'One Q1 manuscript was submitted to BMC Medical Education on Sep 14, 2025 (within the project timeline) but not yet published. The publication verification rule requires accepted/published work ≥3 months after the award. Submission only partially meets expectations; however, the progress is reasonable for Month 9 of Year 1.', 'Excellent involvement: 3 RAs hired with detailed dates and job IDs, plus one graduate student actively participating. Activities include literature review, data collection, recruitment, and analysis—fully aligned with the proposal’s commitments.', 1, 1, NULL, '2025-11-24 18:30:49', '2025-11-24 18:30:49', 5, 'Year 1 budget: 129,442.35 QAR expected expenses out of 150,000 QAR, representing 86.3% utilization, exceeding the required 60% threshold. Spending is justified and aligned with planned activities (RAs, conference, APC).'),
(68, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 183, 239, 'pending', 5, 5, 5, 'The project demonstrates strong progress across all WPs. WP1 is fully completed, WP2 and WP3 are actively advancing, and WP4 preparations are clear and scheduled. Tangible outputs include datasets, frameworks, and training resources under development. The milestones achieved align with the proposal commitments.', 'One Q1 journal already published (eligible and correctly authored), two conference papers accepted, and two high-impact journal submissions under review. All publications fall well after the award date and list the LPI as an author. This exceeds expectations for Year 1.', 'The project shows exceptional student engagement: 1 PhD, four postgraduates, and four undergraduates formally involved, contributing to research outputs and manuscripts. This exceeds the proposal’s expectations and demonstrates strong capacity building.', 1, 1, NULL, '2025-11-24 18:35:28', '2025-11-24 18:38:35', 5, '220,000 QAR of 300,000 QAR used (~73%), meeting the ≥60% guideline. Spending is aligned with research needs; however, the report notes administrative delays in reimbursements for essential GenAI software, which could slow progress if unresolved.'),
(69, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 73, 245, 'pending', 3, 1, 1, 'Generally, some progress has been made within the year. The first two objectives: \r\n1. \"To identify promising quit....\"\r\n\r\n\r\n2. \"To select the three most frequently identified and...\"', 'No journal publication yet. \r\nAuthors claim to submit one by November 2025', 'Number of students committed is TWO, but no student involvement on project as yet.', 1, 1, NULL, '2025-11-25 02:54:14', '2025-11-25 07:08:13', 4, 'There is about 53% in actual expenditure and a commitment of 64% in the first year'),
(70, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 18, 57, 'pending', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, '2025-11-25 03:09:44', '2025-11-25 03:09:44', NULL, NULL),
(71, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 73, 303, 'pending', 3, 4, 4, 'There is some significant amount of work remaining', 'Committed to 3 publication and one publication achieved', 'One PhD student recruited. Initial commitment was 2', 1, 1, NULL, '2025-11-25 04:10:15', '2025-11-25 04:10:15', 5, 'Report indicates 100% utilization of budget in Year 1 and Year 2.'),
(72, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 73, 304, 'pending', 4, 2, 5, 'One objective completed, two in progress and one not started.', 'One committed application but no evidence of journal submission', 'No commitment', 1, 1, NULL, '2025-11-25 04:23:31', '2025-11-25 04:23:31', 5, 'Evidence of 100% budget utilization for year 1 and 2'),
(73, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 73, 274, 'pending', 4, 4, 4, 'Appears on course to achieving project outcomes', 'One Q1  publication as per year, as commitment. \r\nOne Q2 publication per year, as per commitment', 'Two Postgraduate students on the project. Two undergraduate students on the project', 1, 1, NULL, '2025-11-25 07:18:47', '2025-11-25 07:19:34', 3, '64% utilization'),
