(84, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 75, 228, 'pending', 3, 4, 4, 'The results section is minor. I recommend adding more details, figures, tables to illustrate the results achieved/detailed progress toward achieving outcomes.', 'Two publications in Q1: one submitted and one accepted with major revision. There is also book chapter under printing', '3 research assistants recruited and one master student', -1, 1, NULL, '2025-12-10 05:23:29', '2025-12-17 04:57:51', 4, NULL),
