(87, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 48, 306, 'pending', 4, 3, 4, 'The authors successfully accomplished the majority of the objectives outlined in the Year 1, and Year 2 Grant Proposal.', 'The authors have published TWO  papers and have indicated that several other papers are still in preparation. However, the Acknowledgement section does not include the Grant No. of this project.', '1 Student has been involved, named: Thuraiya Al Harthi, s115307, Sultan Qaboos University, Anas Al \r\nRashdi, s107338, Sultan Qaboos University', -1, 1, NULL, '2025-12-11 15:29:23', '2025-12-11 15:29:23', 5, 'Actual Expenses: QAR 136,213.52 for Y-2'),
(88, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 48, 248, 'pending', 4, 4, 4, 'The authors successfully accomplished the majority of the objectives outlined in the Year 1 Grant Proposal.', 'The authors have  review manuscript: Next-Generation Phytoremediation Approaches for Environmental \r\nSustainability; Submitted to New Biotechnology Journal, Impact Factor 4.9, Q1.\r\n2. Submitted original research manuscript: Heavy Metal-Induced Stress in Desert Flora: Insights \r\nfrom Chromium-Exposed Prosopis juliflora, Submitted to Process Biochemistry Journal, Impact \r\nFactor 4, Q2.', 'Two RAs have been employed in this project.\r\no RA: Ms. Nur Fathin Ruslan, 01/06/2025 – 30/10/2025, Job# 21969\r\no RA: Ms. Maryam Dan Inna, 05/03/2025 – 31/05/2025 & 01/10/2025 – 30/12/2025, Job# 21857', -1, 1, NULL, '2025-12-11 15:54:48', '2025-12-11 15:54:48', 4, 'Actual Expenses: QAR 128,000'),
(89, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 48, 272, 'pending', 4, 3, 3, 'The authors successfully accomplished the majority of the objectives outlined in the Year 1 Grant Proposal', 'Two manuscripts are under preparation', 'One RA; Research Assistant: \r\nMr. Assem Taha Mohammed, Date ( 15/01/2025). Job number 18321', -1, 1, NULL, '2025-12-11 16:06:20', '2025-12-11 16:06:20', 5, 'Actual Expenses : QAR 142790'),
