(97, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 184, 232, 'pending', 4, 5, 5, NULL, 'One has been published and three are under review.', 'Three students were recruited in the first year.', -1, 1, NULL, '2025-12-15 12:25:49', '2025-12-21 08:02:36', 5, '223,161.07 QAR was spent out of the awarded 300,000 QAR'),
(98, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 184, 279, 'pending', 4, 4, 4, 'IRB is not secured.', 'One review paper was published; one is under review.', '1 Master student and 1 PhD student were involved.', 0, 1, NULL, '2025-12-15 12:34:54', '2025-12-23 04:40:36', 5, '100% utilized.'),
(99, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 74, 265, 'pending', 3, 2, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, '2025-12-17 07:09:20', '2025-12-17 07:09:20', 5, NULL),
(100, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 72, 290, 'pending', 4, 4, 5, 'The progress report looks satisfactory. The article \"In The Emir\'s Own...\" is in final stages of submission. The second article \"The Ally on Trial\" is also ready for submission. In addition to this, some QU students were hired, majority of whom are Qataris; they received training in data collection and coding, which fulfills the capacity building goals.', 'Satisfactory progress. See #1 above.', 'Excellent engagement of students.', -1, 1, NULL, '2025-12-17 09:06:46', '2025-12-22 05:43:09', 5, '100% of the budget utilized.'),
(101, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 75, 286, 'pending', 5, 5, 5, 'There is a very good progress made towards the outcomes which were proposed. In addition, an extra task was carried out as part of this project, specifically: Development of a Machine\r\nLearning model for the\r\nprediction of wave heights in\r\nQatar waters.', 'One book chapter accepted for publication. One paper under review (Q2). Three papers are near completion (plan to submit to Q1 journals).  Two more papers are under preparation (plan to submit to Q1 journals).', 'two RAs and one UG student', -1, 1, NULL, '2025-12-21 07:32:08', '2025-12-21 07:32:24', 5, '96% is utilized'),
(102, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 39, 249, 'pending', 3, 3, 3, 'A substantial amount of the planned research work has been done by the research team. The work done is a little bit ahead of the planned activities. PSF Membranes have been synthesised , characterised and tested for synthetic water. good work', 'The research team claims that one review paper has bee accepted with minor changes which is a good result. However, no details or reference to the paper as there was no ISN or any reference number number declared by the LPI. Therefore i am not able to verify the authenticity of this claim.', 'One MSc student was involved in the project. details of the student were given.', -1, 1, NULL, '2025-12-22 04:04:59', '2025-12-22 04:04:59', 3, 'The progress report template does not contain any section for budget utilisation. i am unable to verify this condition. Furthermore, the NCBP project proposal template does not contain any section for the LPI engagement in term of publications, students, RAs engagement...etc. i suggest to review the template.'),
(103, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 39, 256, 'pending', 3, 5, 2, 'The progress report show a steady progress in the implementation of the proposal as planned. the project has so far came up with two publication which is an excellent result.', 'Two publications have been generated from the project in the first year which is beyond the expectations for year 1', 'No students were engaged in the project. However, one RA was recruited and mentioned in details in the report ( detailed name and Job number)', -1, 1, NULL, '2025-12-22 04:18:20', '2025-12-22 04:18:20', 4, 'More than 70% of the year 1 budget was consumed.'),
(104, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 39, 300, 'pending', 2, 1, 3, 'The research team has managed to complete only 2 main tasks out of 5 tasks proposed in the research plan, the achieved tasks are mainly related to data collection with no analysis done so far. i strongly emphasis that the team make extra efforts in the second year to complete the proposed tasks in time with a an acceptable outcome', 'The research team declared 5 papers to be published in year 1, so far no publication has been issued.', 'Two RAs have been employed in the project with no student being engaged in the research work.', -1, 1, NULL, '2025-12-22 04:32:44', '2025-12-22 04:32:44', 4, 'more than 90% of the budget have been used.'),
(105, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 39, 261, 'pending', 3, 2, 3, 'The progress report showed scattered task being performed by the research team, with only 2 completed tasks so far, while the other are ongoing. The research team should take extra measures to make sure that all planned task should be completed in adequate time.', 'In the proposal 4 papers ( Q1 +Q2) are expected from this research, so far, no publication has been issued.', 'One MSc student with one PhD candidates were involved in the project .However, their details are missing in the report.', -1, 1, NULL, '2025-12-22 04:45:02', '2025-12-22 04:45:02', 4, 'More than 90% of the project budget has been used.'),
(106, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 72, 263, 'pending', 3, 2, 3, 'As per Work Plan of the proposal, by the end of the 6th month, the qualitative phase will be over and by the end of month-10, questionnaires will be ready. \r\nAccording to the Report, the qualitative phase was completed on Sep 22. But, the IRB was not obtained at the time of the submission, which suggests that interviews were conducted without the IRB approval.\r\nMoreover, the language of Table II, Row-3 is confusing as it uses the future tense “will be”, yet it is reported to have been completed', 'The output section of the progress report does not say anything about the progress made so far. I know that the quantitative data are yet to be collected, but some information especially lit review is expected to be in the Table.', 'No commitment was made in the proposal.', -1, 0, NULL, '2025-12-22 05:40:00', '2025-12-22 05:40:00', 3, 'Over 50% of the budget has been utilized.'),
(107, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 72, 289, 'pending', 4, 3, 5, 'The progress is satisfactory; literature review & theoretical framework have been completed. Analysis of course descriptions and questionnaires also done.\r\nPage-8 of proposal indicates use of focus group and surveys, but the table on P-13 says no ethical compliance is required. This is confusing. At any rate, it is good to see that IRB was finally obtained, but the IRB approval has not been submitted with the report.', 'The data collection has started so the writing of he findings will begin soon.', 'Four students have been recruited on the project.', 0, 1, NULL, '2025-12-23 05:01:43', '2025-12-23 05:04:21', 3, 'One third of the budget for year-1 has been used.'),
(108, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 72, 252, 'pending', 5, 5, 5, 'Archival research has been completed. Three papers have been submitted. However, ethical compliance is missing.\r\nThe proposal on page-5 mentions interviews with key stakeholders in Qatar’s aviation sector, yet on Ethical Considerations section, No ethical approval required is indicated. Firthermore, in the progress report, it is written that interviews are going on, which is a violation of human subject involvement ethics. IRB approval is required prior to interviews with stakeholders.', 'Three papers, two of which are Q-1, are under review in different journals. Two more papers are under preparation.', 'Three research assistants and three students have been hired, but some of their ID\'s are not mentioned.', 0, 0, NULL, '2025-12-23 06:00:22', '2025-12-23 06:00:22', 2, '18% of the budget allocate for year-1 has been used.'),
(109, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 72, 255, 'pending', 4, 5, 3, 'The progress is very good. Literature review and theoretical frameworks identified and completed. Three papers are under review in Q-1 journals. Names of the journals are, however, not mentioned.\r\nThere is an issue of ethical compliance. In the Field Research and Data Collection section, the proposal mentions interviews with architects, historians, and residents which will be transcribed and analyzed. However, in the Compliance and Ethical Considerations Table, it is written that no human subjects will be involved. This is contradictory. No IRB approval has been submitted in the report.', 'Excellent. Three papers under review.', 'It is reported that three students were supervised. Their names and ID\'s are not mentioned.', -1, 1, NULL, '2025-12-23 06:36:58', '2025-12-23 06:36:58', 2, 'About 26% of the budget allocated to year-1 has been used.'),
(110, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 39, 287, 'pending', 4, 4, 3, 'The team has completed a large amount of the planned activities which make them ahead of the schedule', 'Three publications have been generated from the work. excellent results', 'One undergraduate student was involved with the project with two RAs hired from the project budget.', -1, 1, NULL, '2025-12-23 07:30:00', '2025-12-23 07:30:00', 4, 'More than 75% of year 1 budget was used.'),
(111, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 73, 275, 'pending', 3, 3, 2, 'Project is yet to pick up with several aims yet to be achieved.', 'No publication record', 'No data on student engagement or capacity building', 1, 1, NULL, '2025-12-23 07:33:47', '2025-12-23 07:33:47', 2, 'No indication of Actual Expenses'),
(112, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 39, 292, 'pending', 3, 1, 1, 'The report indicates that a good deal of the project\'s planned activities have been done', 'No publications have been generated from the research work', 'Student engagement was not mentioned in the report', -1, 0, NULL, '2025-12-23 07:41:07', '2025-12-23 07:41:07', 1, 'No budget usage was mentioned in the progress report'),
(113, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 72, 294, 'pending', 2, 2, 3, 'The report lacks specific information making it difficult to assess progress made. It is mentioned that 2 articles were published but no information is given about them. Table-V does not mention any articles published in the column Achieved outcomes. Table-6 of the report is empty.', 'Of the 4 articles committed in the proposal (p-9), the progress report claims that 2 have been published (Section III). There are, however, no details of where they were published. Also, Table V does not mention any publications. This discrepancy was pointed out in last year\'s review as well. Because of lack of sufficient information, is not possible to accurately review the progress.  \r\nTable-6 which requires information about the goals planned for next year is empty. This makes it further difficult to asses progress in publications.', 'The names of two students that were hired are given but their ID\'s are not. This was pointed out in the last review as well. Furthermore, one students was hired for only 1 month, the other for 5 months.', -1, 0, NULL, '2025-12-23 09:57:46', '2025-12-23 09:57:46', 5, 'Over 90% of the budget allocated to year-2 has been utilized.'),
(114, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 74, 296, 'pending', 4, 3, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 1, NULL, '2025-12-24 03:00:05', '2025-12-26 04:26:10', 5, NULL),
(115, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 72, 298, 'pending', 4, 4, 5, 'This is a two year project running into its second year. IRB was obtained since the last report. Based on the data analysis, one research paper has been published in a good journal.', 'Two articles--one in Q-1 and the other in Q-2 were committed. As per the report one article in the International Journal of Developmental Disabilities is out. This is a Q-2 journal. Table V mentions that the goal of publishing two articles has been achieved. However, there is no information about the second article in the report.', 'Good Progress. Three students were recruited on the project. The ID of one of them is missing.', 1, 1, NULL, '2025-12-24 03:49:51', '2025-12-24 03:49:51', 4, 'About 90% of the budget has been utilized.'),
(116, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 72, 305, 'pending', 1, 1, 1, 'Suspended. No IRB approval submitted this year as well.', NULL, NULL, -1, 0, NULL, '2025-12-24 03:56:26', '2025-12-24 03:56:26', 1, NULL);
INSERT INTO `progress_report_grading` (`id`, `analysis`, `comments`, `recommendation`, `path`, `user_id`, `project_id`, `publish`, `achievementsRating`, `publicationsRating`, `studentsRating`, `achievementsComments`, `publicationsComments`, `studentsComments`, `ethical`, `isAccepted`, `report_type`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `budgetRating`, `budgetComments`) VALUES
(117, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 39, 270, 'pending', 3, 2, 1, 'The research team claim that they \'s managed to cover the project objectives for year 1. However, the results presented are vague without any supporting document or writing.', 'The team claims that they have submitted two journal papers without any evidence.', 'No data were supplied for student engagement or RAs hiring. detailed data are required', -1, 1, NULL, '2025-12-25 12:23:34', '2025-12-25 12:23:34', 4, 'more than 80% of the project\'s budget was consumed.'),
(118, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 48, 251, 'pending', 2, 2, 1, 'According to the submitted report, the LPI stated that the majority of the objectives outlined in the Year 1 Grant Proposal were successfully accomplished. However, no supporting data were presented or discussed.', 'The LPI reported the publication of a Q2-ranked article in May 2025. However, no information was provided regarding the article title or the journal in which it was published.', 'No students or research assistants were involved in or hired for this project.', NULL, 0, NULL, '2025-12-31 05:02:03', '2025-12-31 05:02:03', 1, 'The LPI has spent only 8875.46 QAR out of 100,000 QAR'),
(119, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 71, 260, 'pending', 4, 4, 5, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, '2026-02-25 07:16:19', '2026-02-25 07:16:19', 5, NULL),
(120, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 71, 247, 'pending', 3, 3, 3, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, '2026-03-15 05:08:12', '2026-03-15 05:08:12', 4, NULL),
(121, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 183, 309, 'pending', 2, 1, 2, 'Milestones achieved in preparation (e.g., literature review, interview guide, IRB submission, 1 PhD RA hired). Last updated end of Year 1, Aim 4 (first stage data collection): \"Not Started\". The project is 11 months old. No fieldwork, no prototype/patent/software (n/a by design – qualitative study). Good foundation but timeline is way into year 2.', 'No publications, submissions, or manuscripts in preparation reported. Proposal committed to 4 indexed journal articles. Year 1 qualitative-first design rarely resulted in empirical papers. One missed opportunity was a protocol or scoping review from the completed literature review .', 'Only one PhD Research Assistant was recruited and trained. Proposal committed to 3 UG + 2 MSc students – none reported as engaged. Section V, RA name, job number and student QUIDs requested. Capacity-building deliverables are well off track from commitment.', 0, 0, NULL, '2026-05-06 16:37:29', '2026-05-06 16:37:29', 1, 'Year-1: Actual expenses: 25,200 / 127,000 QAR ≈ 19.8% – well below the 60% threshold required. Shows significant under-performance of planned activities A revised expenditure forecast and corrective spending plan for Year 2 are needed.'),
(122, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 183, 312, 'pending', 3, 2, 3, 'Foundational infrastructure established. WP1 (participatory mapping) is progressing well—the first workshop was held, 30 entries are on the digital map, and ~60 assets are documented. WP2 (Oral history) is at pilot stage only (1 interview). WP3 and WP4 are not started (deferred to Year 2). The N/A is for prototype/patent/software (this is a humanities/social-science project). The year-1 trajectory is modest but coherent. Some items seem delayed relative to the proposed timeline (e.g., 7-10 oral histories planned by May 2026).', 'Journal articles published, accepted or submitted: Nil to date. One manuscript on participatory research is “under preparation.” commitment of 1-2 Q1 + 1-2 Q2 articles Qualitative humanities work is acceptable at Year 1 drafting level, but no definite venue or submission timeline is reported. Year 2: LPI should identify target journals and dates for submission.', '2 UG students recruited and actively engaged in mapping, facilitation of workshops and AV documentation – meeting that part of the commitment. However, there are no QUIDs, RA names, or job numbers listed (these are specifically required in the Section V instructions), and none of the 1 committed graduate students have been recruited. Capacity building documentation needs to be improved.', 1, 1, NULL, '2026-05-06 16:57:22', '2026-05-06 16:57:22', 2, 'Only ~26.8% of the year-1 budget expended (21,882.36 / 81,618 QAR). Does not meet institutional threshold of 60%. The LPI offers reasonable justifications (maternity leave, sick leave of team member, regional instability, contextual challenges with participatory engagement). However, the low utilization and partial fieldwork suggest the need for an aggressive spending and activity ramp-up in Year-2. We should ask for an update on the budget timeline.'),
(123, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 72, 310, 'pending', 1, 1, 3, 'As per the proposal, between months 3-5, the Team WA-2 would have completed data collection and WA-3 would have completed the analysis between months 6-7. However in the report. it is mentioned that data collection has not started yet.', 'With regard to publications, the report mentions, \"First draft completed and under revision\". One wonders how a draft is completed if the data collection has not even started.', 'Students are working being supervised.', 0, 0, NULL, '2026-05-14 06:33:45', '2026-05-14 06:33:45', 1, 'No money has been spent.'),
(124, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 72, 313, 'pending', 2, 2, 4, 'As per the timeline given in the proposal, between the months of 5-12, both quantitative and qualitative data collection should have been completed. From month 12-16, data analysis will be completed. The progress report however shows that data collection through surveys, interviews, and focus groups has not even started.', 'In the progress report, it is mentioned that one paper is being revised for submission. In absence of any data, how is the paper under preparation and as per the report “ahead of time”?', 'In terms of capacity building, the report mentions hiring 2 students on the project.', 0, 0, NULL, '2026-05-14 07:22:54', '2026-05-14 07:22:54', 1, 'From the report it looks like no money has been utilized.'),
(125, '0', '0', '0', NULL, 72, 311, 'pending', 3, 5, 5, NULL, 'Satisfactory progress has been made. Qualitative data collection has been completed and the quantitative data is currently being collected.', 'Excellent. Two UG students were hired as promised. one post doc was hired as well.', 1, 1, NULL, '2026-05-14 08:33:49', '2026-05-14 08:33:49', 4, 'Over 50% of the budget has been used.'),
