(345, 'QUST-2-CENG-2025-511', 2402, 'Autonomous Robotic Intubation System', 'Accepted', NULL, NULL, '0.00', 208, 52, '2026-04-04 13:35:13', '2026-04-30 08:24:13', b'0', '7460', 'Awarded', '* Afnan Saddik QUID not provided\n* Please add Plagiarism report with percentage not exceeding 10%\n- * Please be aware that Software/items/books provided by QU are non-allowable items in budget', 'Awarded', 7054, 'funds used to buy: image sensor, raspberry Pi and cooler, case, display. Tracheal manikin, force sensors, position control DC motors. All procured through Voltaat.', 'NA', 'All 3 students engaged in a thorough literature review before working on their subsystem. Fatma worked on the design and implementation of the feeding mechanism and tongue depressor. Alreem on the design and implementation of the embedded system and the tube orientation mechanism. Afnan worked on the design and implementation of the AI-driven control system. They could engage well with each other and advisors.', 'save', 0),
(346, 'QUST-2-CENG-2025-514', 2403, 'Melamine-Assisted Fabrication of Sulfur-Doped Carbon Catalysts: Exploring Electrolyte Temperature Effects on Water Splitting Performance', 'Accepted', NULL, NULL, '0.00', 209, 52, '2026-04-04 13:35:16', '2026-04-30 03:01:30', b'0', '20000', NULL, '* Research Project Plan and Expected Outcomes (Not to exceed 3 pages),\n* Plagiarism report percentage exceeds 10% ', 'Awarded', 19468, 'Supplies and minor lab consumables - thermocouples, gases, heating elements, synthesis supplies.', 'Too early, one journal paper writing in progress.', 'The student worked on synthesizing nanomaterials used in the electrocatalytic water-splitting reaction. Some of the characterizations are ongoing, and we expect to publish one paper based on this work. The student is leading the experimental work and writing the paper. As the work is part of the student\'s PhD thesis, the results will be further utilized beyond the duration of the student grant.', 'save', 0),
(347, 'QUST-2-CENG-2025-515', 2404, 'Design of Metal Oxide based Redox Flow Batteries ', 'Accepted', NULL, NULL, '0.00', 209, 52, '2026-04-04 13:35:17', '2026-04-30 03:27:29', b'0', '20000', NULL, ' - please add the total budget', 'Awarded', 18590, 'Supplies and minor lab equipment components related to redox flow batteries.', 'No publication yet, possibly in future based on the outcomes.', 'The student participated in experimental activities related to the assembly of the system, the synthesis of electrolytes, the development of testing methods, and the characterization of the samples. As the characterization work takes time, we anticipate obtaining publishable-quality data in the future.', 'save', 0),
